  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1188673/description_196f6f98-864c-4169-9b08-4a2f7f9fa0ba.png\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">新增超过15种菜肴，以及一种非常独特的药水。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1188673/description_e8d34b19-74aa-43fb-aea1-cafebfa71022.png\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">隆重介绍迈达斯之触效果！</span></p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1188673/description_84690c49-3606-4451-b0ca-076ff64aa6ac.png\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通过捕捉极其稀有、传奇的迈达斯鱼，你可以使用切菜板获得迈达斯鱼肉碎。食用迈达斯鱼肉碎将赋予你迈达斯之触效果，可在10秒内将你开采的所有物品变成金质。若想进一步利用此效果，可将其酿成迈达斯之触药水。若想获得更长的效果持续时间，可在迈达斯之触药水中加入红石以延长效果。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br>需要安装农夫乐事、潮汐与异域美食</span></p><hr><h3><em>喜欢潮汐乐事？来看看我的其他模组：</em><em style=\"font-size:16px\"><br><br></em></h3><h3><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1197295/description_28656b03-9b0f-4204-b92a-6a2184075651.png\" width=\"249\" height=\"249\"></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critter-colonies-for-minecolonies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生</a></strong></span><strong><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critter-colonies-for-minecolonies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">物</a></strong><strong style=\"color:#fff;font-size:16px\"><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critter-colonies-for-minecolonies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">群落（为 Minecolonies 设计）</a></strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1084244/description_206db7ed-db55-4a24-886d-a5e549771d86.png\" width=\"116\" height=\"58\"><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-beginnings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">更好的开端</span></a></strong></em></p><p><br><em><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1188673/description_61d5e43e-8b6b-4505-b1c9-4553625ece93.png\" width=\"222\" height=\"222\"><br><strong><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts-continued\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">生物与野兽：延续</span></a></strong></span></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
